ZkPassportMethodKatTest
├── when replaying the config vector encodings
│   ├── it should read a file in the four field layout
│   └── it should reproduce every frozen config encoding
├── when replaying the config vectors through verify
│   └── it should call the root verifier with each rows fields and the accepted version, and accept the proof
├── when replaying the config vectors with another returned identifier
│   └── it should refuse the proof
├── when replaying the proof vector encodings
│   └── it should reproduce every frozen proof encoding
├── when replaying the proof vector renderings
│   └── it should render every frozen digest as the required custom data
├── when replaying the proof vectors through verify
│   └── it should pass the decoded fields to the root verifier and accept the proof
├── when replaying the proof vectors with uppercase custom data
│   └── it should refuse the proof
├── when replaying the proof vectors with unprefixed custom data
│   └── it should refuse the proof
├── when replaying the proof vectors with the nullifier input changed
│   └── it should refuse the proof
├── when replaying the proof vectors with another input changed
│   └── it should accept the proof
└── when replaying the proof vectors under another digest
    └── it should refuse the proof
